Z||000002||sqoach||10-29-2001||12:04 AM||||Ignition module? I hope those don't cost very much. Low on money as it is.<BR>I think my idle search is due to some vacuum leaks. Some of my hoses look a little worn. Wasn't sure if that contributed to my car dieing.||||reg||1
