Z||000004||ChopTop||10-29-2001||02:16 PM||||Sqoach, no answer but our 88 4 cylinder is having stalling problems too.  Our mechanic installed new plugs, checked timing and sparkplug wires, couldn't get it to stall.  Stalled again on her few days later, I replaced the EGR valve and drove it several day, no problem.  She ran some errands, stalled again.  Seems to only happen when it's hot and she drives it, hmmmmm.  I don't have any diagnostic equipment so it's going back to him tonight.  I'll repost if the problem is discovered.||||reg||1
